<!-- Golden case I: a percentage Zuschlag is unmodelled, not unknown.

     One invoice, one patient: GOÄ 2440 (operative Entfernung eines Naevus flammeus) at the
     Schwellenwert 2.3, and beside it GOÄ 441, the Zuschlag for using a laser during an ambulant
     operative Leistung. 441 is exactly what such an invoice looks like in practice, and it is the
     line this engine used to get wrong.

     § 5 GOÄ states Nummer 441 as a percentage of another Ziffer's einfacher Gebührensatz — "… v. H.
     des einfachen Gebührensatzes" — so the law gives it no Punktzahl, the importer has nothing to
     import, and `data/catalogs/goae_current/unparsed_rows.json` records exactly that with
     `typ: prozent_zuschlag` (Nummer 5298, the Zuschlag for digital radiography, is the other one).
     The audit nonetheless reported it as `unknown_ziffer`, severity `error`, with the message "ist
     im Katalog … nicht enthalten" — which a billing centre reads, correctly, as "your delivery is
     coded against a GOÄ version we do not hold". That is a defect in their export, and it was not
     true: the gap is ours, and it is that we do not model surcharges.

     Expected: GOÄ 441 gets the verdict `surcharge_not_modelled` and a `padnext_surcharge_not_
     modelled` finding at severity `info` — nothing to correct — while the money stays exactly where
     `unknown_ziffer` put it, in `unconfirmed`. The three-bucket model does not move for this: a
     surcharge is no more judged than an unknown Ziffer is, and the only thing that changes is
     whose gap the report names. GOÄ 2440 is untouched beside it: `chargeable`, 107.25 €,
     `unconfirmed`, because no verified rule bears on it.

     441 carries `einzelbetrag` rather than `faktor` for the same reason it carries no `punktzahl`:
     there is no Punktzahl to multiply, so the amount is the one the percentage produced —
     100 v. H. of 800 Punkte × 5,82873 ct = 46,63 €. The engine recomputes neither, and counts the
     46,63 € as `unpriceable_claimed_eur`.

     Synthetic data throughout: echtdaten="0". -->
